---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /our-people/mentors/
title: Mentors
description: The mentors who coach, teach and encourage the students of LYNK Robotics, FRC Team 9496.
socialImage: /assets/img/mentors/bob-bell.jpg
---

<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero__media" src="/assets/img/hero/mentors.webp" alt="" width="1280" height="720" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="hero__scrim"></div>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <h1>Mentors — LYNK</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--wide">
      {%- for m in mentors %}
        <article class="person">
          <img
            class="person__photo"
            src="{{ m.photo }}"
            alt="{{ m.name }}"
            width="500"
            height="500"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="person__name">{{ m.name }}</p>
            <p class="person__title">{{ m.title }}</p>
            <p class="person__role">{{ m.role }}</p>
            <p class="person__why"><b>My whY:</b> {{ m.why }}</p>
            <p class="person__since">
              Mentor: {{ m.since }}{% if m.alum %} · {{ m.alum }}{% endif %}
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark section--center section--tight">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <h2>Interested in mentoring?</h2>
    <p class="prose prose--center">
      Mentoring these students is a rewarding opportunity, and doesn’t require any
      experience with robotics. We are always looking for additional help.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 1.5rem">
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
